<title>POLAND: OKOCIM FEB NET FALLS TO PLN 1.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>OKOCIM FEB NET FALLS TO PLN 1.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.23 vs   2.35</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.70 vs   3.10</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.49 vs   3.74</p>
<p> Sales		   17.42 vs  10.58</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.28 vs   1.93</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 4.33 vs   4.53</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.75 vs   5.77</p>
<p> Sales		   34.35 vs  21.45</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish brewer is Okocimskie Zaklady</p>
<p>Piwowarskie Okocim SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
